// Bundled variable font — imported here so every consumer of the Material
// library registers it (see the collect_custom_fonts pass, which walks all
// documents in the compilation). The theme's brand/plain families default to
// "Google Sans Flex". The bundled "Roboto Flex" alternative is opt-in —
// import "roboto_flex.slint" to register it.
